  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392",
      "udi": "umb://element/ed65fd41dd374e55a9ac54bf0edad1a8",
      "title": "المادة الأولى",
      "content": {
        "markup": "<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 21.45pt 0in 0in;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\">يؤهل المطورون العقاريون بناء على المعايير الآتية:<br>1- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات المالية.<br>2- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات الفنية.<br>3- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات المؤسسية والموارد البشرية.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "header": ""
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392",
      "udi": "umb://element/6195238927a44bd996ad149d9359cb66",
      "title": "المادة الثانية",
      "content": {
        "markup": "<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 21.45pt 12.0pt 0in;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\">يجتاز المطور العقاري التأهيل بعد حصوله على الدرجة وفق الآتي:</p>\n<div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"680\" class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 510.3pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-table-dir: bidi;\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 23.35pt;\">\n<td width=\"425\" style=\"width: 318.7pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 23.35pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>حجم المساهمة العقارية</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"199\" style=\"width: 149.4pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 23.35pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>رأس مال المنشأة في السجل التجاري</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"137\" style=\"width: 103.05pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 23.35pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>درجة التأهيل المطلوبة</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 17.95pt;\">\n<td width=\"425\" style=\"width: 318.7pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 17.95pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">مساهمة صغيرة يقل رأس مالها عن خمسين مليون ريال</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"199\" style=\"width: 149.4pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 17.95pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\">100,000 </span>ريال فأكثر</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"137\" style=\"width: 103.05pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 17.95pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\">40 درجة فأكثر</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; height: 4.9pt;\">\n<td width=\"425\" style=\"width: 318.7pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 4.9pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">مساهمة متوسطة لا يقل رأس مالها عن خمسين مليون ريال ولا يزيد عن ثلاث مئة مليون ريال</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\">.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"199\" style=\"width: 149.4pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 4.9pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\">500,000 </span>ريال فأكثر</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"137\" style=\"width: 103.05pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 4.9pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\">50 درجة فأكثر</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<td width=\"425\" style=\"width: 318.7pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">مساهمة كبيرة يتجاوز رأس مالها ثلاث مئة مليون ريال.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"199\" style=\"width: 149.4pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\">مليون ريال فأكثر</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"137\" style=\"width: 103.05pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\">60 درجة فأكثر</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "header": ""
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392",
      "udi": "umb://element/f2f7b19b45f94fe3b0abca2e2c57f174",
      "title": "المادة الثالثة",
      "content": {
        "markup": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\">تكون متطلبات ومعايير التأهيل وفق الآتي:</p>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 9.55pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>أولاً /القدرات المالية:</strong></p>\n<div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"680\" class=\"MsoTableGrid\" align=\"right\" style=\"width: 510.3pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-table-overlap: never; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-table-lspace: 9.0pt; margin-left: 6.75pt; mso-table-rspace: 9.0pt; margin-right: 6.75pt; mso-table-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-table-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-table-left: center; mso-table-top: .05pt; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-table-dir: bidi;\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 2.8pt; mso-row-margin-right: .85pt;\">\n<td width=\"152\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 113.85pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>المعيار</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"189\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 141.75pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>المتطلبات </strong></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"206\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 2.15in; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>طريقة التقييم</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"72\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 53.65pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>وزن التقييم</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"61\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 45.4pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><strong>النوع</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"1\" style=\"mso-cell-special: placeholder; border: none; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in;\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; mso-row-margin-right: .85pt;\">\n<td width=\"152\" style=\"width: 113.85pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">قوائم مالية من محاسب قانوني معتمد</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"189\" style=\"width: 141.75pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\">\n<p style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: 95%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0in 16.55pt 0in 0in;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1- </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">البيان المالي للمنشآت الحديثة من أقل من سنة.</span></p>\n<p style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: 95%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0in 16.55pt 0in 0in;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2- </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">قوائم مالية لسنة للمنشآت لمن هم أكثر من سنة ولا يقل عن سنتين.</span></p>\n<p style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: 95%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0in 16.55pt 0in 0in;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3- </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">قوائم مالية لسنتين متتاليتين لمنشآت التي يزيد عن انشائها مدة سنتين.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 95%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">القوائم: الأصول المتداولة- الالتزامات النقدية- الأرباح والخسائر</span></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"206\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 2.15in; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\">\n<p style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10.0pt; line-height: 95%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: ar